UV

Purpose

UV is the eighth major electrical tier of the progression.

This stage represents the transition into the highest levels of conventional industrial technology.

UV requires extreme energy production, highly advanced materials, complex processing chains, massive automation, and industrial infrastructure operating at enormous scale.

The objective of UV is to push the factory beyond conventional high-tier automation and prepare the player for UHV and post-endgame progression.

