Modern Industrialization Integration

Modern Industrialization acts as a complementary industrial system.

MI can provide additional machinery and processing capabilities for UV production.

MI systems must follow the established UV progression.

MI must not provide an alternative route that bypasses GregTech requirements.

Mekanism Integration

Mekanism provides advanced chemical processing, refining, energy systems, and industrial utilities.

Its systems can support the enormous scale of UV factories.

Mekanism materials and machines must remain integrated with the main progression.

Mekanism must not provide access to UHV technology before the required progression is completed.

