Exit Condition

UV is completed when the player has established an extreme-scale industrial complex.

UV production must be extensively automated.

Major UV materials must have reliable production.

Important UV components must be produced automatically.

Advanced chemical and material processing must be fully integrated.

Power generation and distribution must support continuous UV production.

The industrial complex must be capable of operating many high-consumption machines simultaneously.

The player must be able to produce the components required for UHV.

After these requirements are fulfilled, UHV is unlocked.

The ultimate goal of UV is to push the industrial complex to the limit of conventional high-tier technology and prepare the player for UHV and the final stages of technological progression.
